      "description": "Primary action with a directional line icon.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-button\" href=\"#\">Start a Project <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#fb5607;color:#212529;padding:14px 25px;border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font:700 13px Inter,sans-serif;text-decoration:none}.ds-button svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7}.ds-button:hover{background:#ff7431;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(33,37,41,.1)}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8338ec;outline-offset:5px}"
